/target
/ghidra_proj
/build
*.log
__pycache__/
/.venv
/mutants.out*
/mutants

# The mage's paid save (1000:764e/1000:765d) writes these into the process's
# current directory, so an interactive `cargo run` from the repo root leaves
# them behind -- and a stray save_r?.sav changes the NEXT run's startup path,
# because the slot menu scans the working directory. The five shipped saves
# live in orig/ under their DOS uppercase names and are not matched here.
/save_r?.sav
/places.sav

# Agent tool state, per-machine. The tessl manifest, AGENTS.md and the vendored
# .tessl/ tree ARE tracked -- CLAUDE.md's `@AGENTS.md` include chains through
# them, so a clone that lacked them would silently load nothing.
/.claude/
/.agents/
/.mcp.json
